OL,3,GNEWSAArrest made after reports of
OL,4,Adisturbance in street
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 51-year-old man has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter police were called to a
OL,8,Fdisturbance in Ilkeston.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Police said a man was
OL,11,Finjured and taken to hospital after the
OL,12,Fdisturbance in Taylor Street at 21:30
OL,13,FGMT on Sunday.
OL,15,FOn Monday, Taylor Street remained
OL,16,Fclosed and a cordon was in place.
OL,18,FPolice have urged witnesses, or anyone
OL,19,Fwith CCTV, doorbell or dashcam footage,
OL,20,Fto come forward.
